1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,289
And from esters.

2
00:00:01,289 --> 00:00:03,841
Acid hydrolysis is reversible.

3
00:00:03,841 --> 00:00:11,328
Alkaline hydrolysis, saponification, goes to completion because the acid is removed as its salt.

4
00:00:11,328 --> 00:00:18,880
Reducing an ester with lithium aluminium hydride gives two alcohols, one from each half of the ester.

